      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in section 11— (i) by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsections: \"(2A) The Ruler shall within thirty days after a Bill is presented to him assent to the Bill. CONSTITUTION (AMENDMENT) (2B) If a Bill is not assented to by the Ruler within the time specified in subsection (2A), it shall become law at the expiration of the time specified in that subsection in the like manner as if he had assented to it.\"; and"
      }
